---
title: News
description: "News and announcements about Anno Arcana: new chapters, releases and conventions."
layout: layouts/page.liquid
permalink: /news/
---
{% comment %}
News posts are written in the Studio (/admin/) and stored in Netlify Database.
They're pulled in at build time as the `news` global data (see eleventy.config.js).
{% endcomment %}
{%- if news.size > 0 %}
  {%- for post in news %}
  {%- unless forloop.first %}
  <div class="fox-divider" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fox-mark"></span></div>
  {%- endunless %}
  <article class="newsPost">
    <h2>{{ post.title }}</h2>
    <p class="newsPost-date">posted on {{ post.posted_on | utcDate }}</p>
    {{ post.body | markdown }}
  </article>
  {%- endfor %}
{%- else %}
  <p>No news yet. Check back soon!</p>
{%- endif %}
